        <item>
            <title>2.37.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 23:43:22 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>123</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.37.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Improvements

- **A live session opens on the iPhone in about half a second.** It used to take seven to nine seconds on a long conversation. Measured on an iPhone over Tailscale against a 41 MB session: 0.53 s.
  - Canopy split the Node shim's output into lines by rescanning the whole buffer on every read, so a 10 MB transcript took 5 s just to find its end. Opening a large session on the Mac itself is faster for the same reason.
  - Screenshots a session read are no longer sent to the phone up front. The phone asks for one when its thumbnail scrolls into view, and gets it at phone size.
  - The phone receives the last 10 turns you typed instead of 30.
  - Canopy starts reading the transcript the moment the phone connects, so the phone has it by the time its page is ready.

### Notes

- The faster path needs the Canopy Mobile TestFlight build from today onward; with an older build the session opens as before.
]]></description>
